Package: evidence
Type: Project
Title: Personal Papers & Evidence Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tomas", "Gonzalez", email = "tgonzalez@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Static-site library for personal academic papers and evidence,
    fed by an R pipeline that parses one-markdown-per-paper sources into a
    JSON consumed by a bilingual web UI.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
